# P0.5 eval harness: nobody's personal text may enter this repo. Corpus
# candidates and the eval TSVs generated from them are derived from private
# notes/chat logs, so keep them outside the repo (point BOPOMIX_EVAL_CORPUS
# at them) or under the ignored eval-corpus/ directory.
# See tools/eval/README.md.
